{"logId": "78436e83-5947-46e3-8b0c-c81bc799691e", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "销售幸福", "block_bbox": [279, 228, 494, 283], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[279.0, 228.0], [494.0, 228.0], [494.0, 283.0], [279.0, 283.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "作者：服饰部/付芳芳", "block_bbox": [335, 293, 493, 314], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[335.0, 293.0], [492.0, 293.0], [492.0, 313.0], [335.0, 313.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "很幸运加入了胖东来这个团队！胖东来是个大家园，人们来商场购物，不仅仅是买东西，而是一种享受，我们甜美的笑容，足以融化每个顾客的心灵。", "block_bbox": [239, 372, 1017, 433], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 372.0], [1017.0, 372.0], [1017.0, 433.0], [239.0, 433.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [73, 603, 225, 725], "block_id": 3, "block_order": null, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[78.99998474121094, 602.9999389648438], [223.9999542236328, 602.9999389648438], [223.9999542236328, 723.9999389648438], [78.99998474121094, 723.9999389648438]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "没有加入这个团队之前，我就比较欣赏胖东来的服务。“不满意就退货”是东来给顾客购物最好的承诺，我们不用担心如果买回去不如意而不能退货这个问题。前段时间，我接待了几位特殊的顾客，一位是那天刚好过生日的老奶奶，另外两位是打扮得很新潮的孙子和他的女朋友。老奶奶刚好要过70大寿，孙子想给奶奶买双鞋作为生日礼物，所以他在认真地挑选合适的鞋子。他找到了双比较轻便舒适的鞋让奶奶试穿，在试穿的过程中，我发现老奶奶的脚也是在旧时代被裹了脚，几个脚趾头聚在一起，脚很瘦很薄，她所试穿的那款鞋穿上并不合适，根本都撑不起来，而且走着有点想掉的样子。这些我全都看在眼里，很快地，有一个鞋扣，不容易掉，而且整体感觉得特别稳重。老奶奶试穿后非常满意，她说最喜欢在胖东来买东西了。男孩听了，笑着对我说：“奶奶呀，就是这样，我说在家附近的鞋店给她买，她还不愿意呢！非要来胖东来买，说有保障，不满意还可以退货。”我听到这，连忙说：“让奶奶回去再试穿一下，如果不喜欢或不舒服的话都可以再拿过来。”男孩很高兴地为奶奶买了这份礼物，在闲暇之余，我与老奶奶愉快地交谈着，夸她真幸福，孙子这么孝顺。老奶奶笑得合不拢嘴，说和我说话很开心，下次买鞋还找我。我说不买也可以来呀，没事的话来转转，还锻炼身体呢。就在这愉快的气氛中，告别了他们。\n现在想起来，我心里挺内疚的，好长时间没回去看望奶奶，不知道她身体好不好，有空的话，一定买好多好吃的去看奶奶。\n帮别人挑选商品也是一种幸福，当你看到顾客脸上挂着满意的笑容时，就会特别的欣慰，特别的幸福！", "block_bbox": [239, 442, 1018, 694], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 442.0], [1018.0, 442.0], [1018.0, 694.0], [239.0, 694.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [239, 714, 787, 1094], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 714.0], [787.0, 714.0], [787.0, 1094.0], [239.0, 1094.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [240, 1103, 818, 1165], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[240.0, 1103.0], [818.0, 1103.0], [818.0, 1165.0], [240.0, 1165.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [239, 1172, 826, 1233], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 1172.0], [826.0, 1172.0], [826.0, 1233.0], [239.0, 1233.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [721, 696, 1061, 1160], "block_id": 8, "block_order": null, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[721.0, 696.0], [1061.0, 696.0], [1061.0, 1160.0], [721.0, 1160.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "雨夜的感动", "block_bbox": [113, 1405, 294, 1447], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[113.0, 1405.0], [294.0, 1405.0], [294.0, 1447.0], [113.0, 1447.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.5151055455207825, "coordinate": [279, 228, 494, 283], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[279.0, 228.0], [494.0, 228.0], [494.0, 283.0], [279.0, 283.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7441024780273438, "coordinate": [335, 293, 493, 314], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[335.0, 293.0], [492.0, 293.0], [492.0, 313.0], [335.0, 313.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9015911817550659, "coordinate": [239, 372, 1017, 433], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[239.0, 372.0], [1017.0, 372.0], [1017.0, 433.0], [239.0, 433.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.5045666694641113, "coordinate": [73, 603, 225, 725], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[78.99998474121094, 602.9999389648438], [223.9999542236328, 602.9999389648438], [223.9999542236328, 723.9999389648438], [78.99998474121094, 723.9999389648438]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8193984627723694, "coordinate": [239, 442, 1018, 694], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[239.0, 442.0], [1018.0, 442.0], [1018.0, 694.0], [239.0, 694.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.3660676181316376, "coordinate": [238, 718, 790, 884], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[238.0, 718.0], [790.0, 718.0], [790.0, 884.0], [238.0, 884.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.42909517884254456, "coordinate": [239, 714, 787, 1094], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[239.0, 714.0], [787.0, 714.0], [787.0, 1094.0], [239.0, 1094.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.44575387239456177, "coordinate": [239, 895, 725, 1093], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[239.0, 895.0], [725.0, 895.0], [725.0, 1093.0], [239.0, 1093.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.48417606949806213, "coordinate": [721, 696, 1061, 1160], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[721.0, 696.0], [1061.0, 696.0], [1061.0, 1160.0], [721.0, 1160.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8204508423805237, "coordinate": [240, 1103, 818, 1165], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[240.0, 1103.0], [818.0, 1103.0], [818.0, 1165.0], [240.0, 1165.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8256369233131409, "coordinate": [239, 1172, 826, 1233], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[239.0, 1172.0], [826.0, 1172.0], [826.0, 1233.0], [239.0, 1233.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.44611552357673645, "coordinate": [113, 1405, 294, 1447], "order": 10, "polygon_points": [[113.0, 1405.0], [294.0, 1405.0], [294.0, 1447.0], [113.0, 1447.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## 销售幸福\n\n作者：服饰部/付芳芳\n\n很幸运加入了胖东来这个团队！胖东来是个大家园，人们来商场购物，不仅仅是买东西，而是一种享受，我们甜美的笑容，足以融化每个顾客的心灵。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_73_603_225_725.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"12%\" /></div>\n\n\n没有加入这个团队之前，我就比较欣赏胖东来的服务。“不满意就退货”是东来给顾客购物最好的承诺，我们不用担心如果买回去不如意而不能退货这个问题。前段时间，我接待了几位特殊的顾客，一位是那天刚好过生日的老奶奶，另外两位是打扮得很新潮的孙子和他的女朋友。老奶奶刚好要过70大寿，孙子想给奶奶买双鞋作为生日礼物，所以他在认真地挑选合适的鞋子。他找到了双比较轻便舒适的鞋让奶奶试穿，在试穿的过程中，我发现老奶奶的脚也是在旧时代被裹了脚，几个脚趾头聚在一起，脚很瘦很薄，她所试穿的那款鞋穿上并不合适，根本都撑不起来，而且走着有点想掉的样子。这些我全都看在眼里，很快地，有一个鞋扣，不容易掉，而且整体感觉得特别稳重。老奶奶试穿后非常满意，她说最喜欢在胖东来买东西了。男孩听了，笑着对我说：“奶奶呀，就是这样，我说在家附近的鞋店给她买，她还不愿意呢！非要来胖东来买，说有保障，不满意还可以退货。”我听到这，连忙说：“让奶奶回去再试穿一下，如果不喜欢或不舒服的话都可以再拿过来。”男孩很高兴地为奶奶买了这份礼物，在闲暇之余，我与老奶奶愉快地交谈着，夸她真幸福，孙子这么孝顺。老奶奶笑得合不拢嘴，说和我说话很开心，下次买鞋还找我。我说不买也可以来呀，没事的话来转转，还锻炼身体呢。就在这愉快的气氛中，告别了他们。\n\n现在想起来，我心里挺内疚的，好长时间没回去看望奶奶，不知道她身体好不好，有空的话，一定买好多好吃的去看奶奶。\n\n帮别人挑选商品也是一种幸福，当你看到顾客脸上挂着满意的笑容时，就会特别的欣慰，特别的幸福！\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_721_696_1061_1160.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"28%\" /></div>\n\n\n## 雨夜的感动", "images": {"imgs/img_in_image_box_73_603_225_725.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//78436e83-5947-46e3-8b0c-c81bc799691e/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_73_603_225_725.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A30%3A08Z%2F-1%2F%2Fb21446d745e906e242d00a3f27b738c74311874164c51996ff4ff648d689193c", "imgs/img_in_image_box_721_696_1061_1160.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//78436e83-5947-46e3-8b0c-c81bc799691e/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_721_696_1061_1160.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A30%3A08Z%2F-1%2F%2F76fc19e538c74b6ce5a95cb9144286f9e1cbc2859606fa448a31de2b5e62ebad"}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//78436e83-5947-46e3-8b0c-c81bc799691e/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A30%3A09Z%2F-1%2F%2Fca0502c69072286a9bd7362e0a2751a537c5706a0fba0f73e9afadd18f5e97c5"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//78436e83-5947-46e3-8b0c-c81bc799691e/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A30%3A09Z%2F-1%2F%2Fd7aa4e7203f7505dc9b132c3ce44847b3fb510616b9810fbcd627ba343295533"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1190, "height": 1684}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//78436e83-5947-46e3-8b0c-c81bc799691e/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A30%3A09Z%2F-1%2F%2F74166dec16bbda1ab4fbeb10597c192f329d7be25d3ba8a69650b0843a63a8ff"]}, "errorCode": 0, "errorMsg": "Success"}
